:: Himari - Heat Sick cure
<<drop $backpack 'antibiotics' 1>>
<<set $characters.himari.quests.heat_cured_day = $game.day>>
<<run setup.himari.addTrust(10)>>
<<addmins 20>>
You lifted her head off the steel and got the pills into her with water from your own bottle. She swallowed without opening her eyes. Her skin was so hot it hurt to touch, and her hand closed around your wrist and held on, and did not let go until the guard cleared his throat in the doorway.
<br /><br />
It was not the guard. It was Negan, leaning on the doorframe with his arms folded, watching the whole thing with great interest.
<br /><br />
<<negan>>
	See that, Dolly? I did that. Me. You remember who takes care of you.
<</negan>>
<br />
He said it to her face, slowly, the way you talk to a dog. She did not understand a word. She nodded anyway, because nodding was safer.
<br /><br />
<strong>(Antibiotics given. Trust +10.)</strong>
<br /><br />
